        "title": "Three face diagonals",
        "body": "The sides of triangle $ABC$ are diagonals of faces of the box: $AB=\\sqrt{1^2+3^2}=\\sqrt{10}$, $AC=\\sqrt{1^2+2^2}=\\sqrt5$, $BC=\\sqrt{2^2+3^2}=\\sqrt{13}$. The shortest is $\\sqrt5$.\n\n**Answer: (B) $\\sqrt5$**"
