    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "$2^{10}+1$"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "$2^{11}-1$"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "$2^{11}+1$"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "$2^{12}-1$"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "$2^{12}+1$"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Work from the inside out",
        "body": "Let $x_1=1+2=3$ and $x_{k+1}=1+2x_k$. Then $x_2=1+2\\cdot3=7$, $x_3=15$: the pattern $x_k=2^{k+1}-1$. (Proof: if $x_k=2^{k+1}-1$ then $x_{k+1}=1+2(2^{k+1}-1)=2^{k+2}-1$.) Equivalently $x_k=1+2+2^2+\\cdots+2^k$. With eleven copies the value is $x_{11}=2^{12}-1$.\n\n**Answer: (D) $2^{12}-1$**"
      }
    ],
