    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Angular speeds",
        "body": "The minute hand moves $6^\\circ$ per minute and the hour hand $\\frac12^\\circ$ per minute, so the minute hand gains $5.5^\\circ$ per minute. At 12:00 they coincide. They first differ by $90^\\circ$ after $\\frac{90}{5.5}=\\frac{180}{11}$ minutes and next by $270^\\circ$ after $\\frac{270}{5.5}=\\frac{540}{11}$ minutes. The gap is $\\frac{360}{11}=32\\frac8{11}$ minutes.\n\n**Answer: (B) $32\\frac8{11}$**"
      }
